# Working docs for the private-endpoints hardening pass - deliberately not committed.
# Get-Nerdio/NMW is a PUBLIC repo, and TEST-PLAN.md / TEST-RESULTS.md / To-Do.md carry lab
# tenant and subscription IDs, the lab NME hostname, and internal (including teammates')
# resource group names. Publishing them is hard to reverse - history, forks, indexing - so
# they stay local. The SPEC-*.md files happen to be free of identifiers, but are kept local
# alongside the rest so the whole working set lives in one place and nothing has to be
# re-audited before a commit.
#
# Note: .gitignore never un-tracks a file that is already committed. If any of these are ever
# added deliberately, scrub the identifiers first.
To-Do.md
TEST-PLAN.md
TEST-RESULTS.md
SPEC-*.md
*.md

# Raw NME/Azure Automation job logs from test runs - verbose, large, and full of the same
# lab identifiers.
test-logs/

.claude/